,"_205":242,"_207":208},{"_195":234,"_197":198,"_199":235,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_205":236,"_207":208},{"_195":228,"_197":198,"_199":229,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_205":230,"_207":208},{"_195":222,"_197":198,"_199":223,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_205":224,"_207":208},{"_195":216,"_197":198,"_199":217,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_205":218,"_207":208},{"_195":196,"_197":198,"_199":200,"_201":202,"_203":204,"_205":206,"_207":208},"_key","249fa7fca2c7","_type","block","children",[209],"level",1,"listItem","bullet","markDefs",[],"style","normal",{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":213,"_214":215},"cd808d0de756","span","marks",[],"text","Luxury landscaping and architectural façade","e9fe700dc304",[219],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":220,"_214":221},[],"Energy-efficient construction","1d830c37c487",[225],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":226,"_214":227},[],"Multiple indoor and outdoor entertaining areas","3a9fa4e6b67a",[231],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":232,"_214":233},[],"Engineered timber flooring","9e79372099b2",[237],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":238,"_214":239},[],"Custom-designed joinery throughout","3a9fa2e060d4",[243],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":244,"_214":245},[],"Designer kitchen with premium appliances and butler’s pantry","fdaddf99d9a1",[249],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":250,"_214":251},[],"Feature fireplace with full-height marble surround","9e629aeafb66",[255],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":256,"_214":257},[],"Premium marble and natural stone throughout","e5cf8968932b",[261],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":262,"_214":263},[],"Floor-to-ceiling architectural glazing","c97a58816d63",[267],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":268,"_214":269},[],"3-metre ceilings throughout","d57d39bde4f5",[273],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":274,"_214":275},[],"Grand double-height entrance with feature void","12834a1e2883",[279],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":280,"_214":281},[],"Dedicated home theatre","ef6b92bd34cc",[285],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":286,"_214":287},[],"Architectural spiral staircase","23a12f193411",[291],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":292,"_214":293},[],"Resort-style swimming pool and integrated spa","de574eb36a64",[297],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":298,"_214":299},[],"Prestigious golf course frontage","6bc0db9aab57",[303],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":304,"_214":305},[],"Approximately 560sqm (60 Squares) custom residence","e311ce228169",[310],[],"h3",{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":311,"_214":312},[],"Key Features","2839ad7792ad",[316],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":317,"_214":318},[],"By managing every stage of the project—from design coordination and approvals through to construction and final handover—we delivered a residence that exceeds expectations in both quality and design.","6ca1b477e11e",[322],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":323,"_214":324},[],"The home features a dramatic double-height entrance, a custom spiral staircase, premium natural stone finishes, bespoke joinery and expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing that frames the surrounding golf course. A resort-style swimming pool and spa create a seamless connection between the indoor living spaces and the outdoor entertaining area, while every material and finish was carefully selected to deliver a timeless, luxurious home.","21f58fd85f3c",[328],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":329,"_214":330},[],"Working closely with the client from concept through to completion, Siari Build delivered a bespoke residence that combines sophisticated architectural design with superior craftsmanship.","c1bf7876449a",[334],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":335,"_214":336},[],"Our Solution","0e9fe8d1d23f",[340],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":341,"_214":342},[],"Executing these design ambitions demanded meticulous planning, precision construction and exceptional attention to detail across every stage of the project.","8e1a3fec833b",[346],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":347,"_214":348},[],"The vision was to create a statement residence that maximised its premium golf course location while delivering uncompromising luxury and everyday practicality. The design required expansive open-plan living, abundant natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor integration and premium architectural detailing throughout, while maintaining privacy, energy efficiency and timeless appeal.","377ee23dc1ca",[352],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":353,"_214":354},[],"The Challenge","a581b14364f3",[358],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":359,"_214":360},[],"Positioned within the prestigious Sanctuary Lakes estate overlooking the golf course, the home seamlessly integrates indoor and outdoor living through floor-to-ceiling glazing, a resort-style swimming pool and spa, and generous entertaining spaces. Every aspect of the residence has been meticulously designed to create a home that is both luxurious and functional.","af2624f57fe4",[364],[],{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":365,"_214":366},[],"The Tiffany Walk Residence is a luxury custom home designed to deliver timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship and resort-style family living. Spanning approximately 560sqm (60 Squares), this residence showcases premium finishes, expansive living spaces and carefully considered architectural details throughout.","6d3fc6ef7496",[371],[],"h2",{"_195":210,"_197":211,"_212":372,"_214":373},[],"Overview",{"_375":376,"_377":378},"settings",{"_414":415,"_416":417,"_418":419,"_420":421,"_422":101,"_423":424,"_425":-5,"_426":427,"_428":382,"_429":-5,"_430":-5,"_431":-5,"_432":433,"_434":435,"_436":-5,"_437":438,"_439":440,"_441":442,"_443":444,"_445":446},"navigation",{"_379":380,"_381":382,"_383":384,"_385":386},"footerMenu",[407,408,409,410,411],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[392,393,394,395],"socialMenu",[387],{"_388":-5,"_389":390,"_127":391},"icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_389":-5,"_397":405,"_399":406},{"_389":-5,"_397":403,"_399":404},{"_389":-5,"_397":401,"_399":402},{"_389":396,"_397":398,"_399":400},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_389":-5,"_397":405,"_399":406},{"_389":-5,"_397":403,"_399":404},{"_389":-5,"_397":401,"_399":402},{"_389":-5,"_397":398,"_399":400},{"_389":-5,"_397":412,"_399":413},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapLocation","mapZoom","notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","siteName","Siari Build","tagline","We don't just build houses. We build the next forty years of your life.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed"]
